--- A. the knob and the stored measure
 thin_min_tickets | no_tickets_every 
------------------+------------------
               20 | 1 day

   column_name    | data_type | is_nullable 
------------------+-----------+-------------
 sellable_tickets | integer   | YES

--- B. THE RULE: 8 sellable tickets is under 20, so T1 takes the one-day band and is pinned
 t1_read 
---------
 ok

--- C. 200 sellable tickets is not thin: T2 keeps its proximity band
 t2_read 
---------
 ok

--- D. THE LANDMINE: T3 has 5,000 GA tickets and ZERO reserved. It must NOT be thin.
 t3_read 
---------
 ok

